 packaging.\n51\t- One-click launch of a pipeline tutorial: importing the tutorial's pipeline\n52\t  into the user's project.\n53\t- Gallery behavior when the tutorial catalog is empty or a tutorial fails\n54\t  validation (surfaced clearly to the user rather than a broken launch).\n55\t- Incidental UI text and in-product guidance for the gallery surface that\n56\t  falls out of this change (no standalone documentation work).\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- The Dashboard shows a tutorial gallery listing the curated tutorials with\n61\t  their packaged metadata.\n62\t- From the gallery, a user can launch a notebook tutorial into their own\n63\t  project with a single action, resulting in a workbench running the\n64\t  tutorial's notebook with the pinned image specified by the tutorial\n65\t  packaging.\n66\t- From the gallery, a user can launch a pipeline tutorial into their own\n67\t  project with a single action, resulting in the pipeline imported into the\n68\t  project.\n69\t- The gallery correctly renders and launches only tutorials that pass their\n70\t  packaged validation status; invalid or missing tutorials are surfaced\n71\t  without breaking the gallery.\n72\t- Gallery and launch flows work for a user scoped to a single project via\n73\t  OpenShift RBAC (no cluster-level permissions required).\n74\t\n75\t## HLR Traceability\n76\t\n77\t| HLR | Priority | Coverage |\n78\t|-----|----------|----------|\n79\t| HLR-1 | P0 | Full — the tutorial gallery and one-click launch into the user's project (workbench with notebook, or pipeline import). |\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8d8892fd3800740b","agent_id":"aede6845dc81fa622","session_id":"d85f781e-f0ad-48f1-91fe-8221a9e97778","uuid":"0f8d3ddd-f576-4300-8f7a-0baa163e2b1c","timestamp":"2026-10-26T15:29:08.180Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e0e7227e26e8a13","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","